The club charter states that each member pays a yearly contribution. The amount of this contribution is fixed in the annex of the charter. [[cite:obs-a6959a3c5ee06489656f9115533798b49a77a33a "Each member pays a yearly contribution; the amount is fixed in the annex of this charter."]]

The annex specifies that the ordinary contribution is one hundred twenty (120) EUR, payable within January. [[cite:obs-940b66dac874fef651265a03f2a32561d30d8a73 "Ordinary contributions: one hundred twenty (120) EUR, payable within January."]]